### ============================================
### CONFIGURACION EMPRESA - GestionInmobiliaria
### ============================================
### Obtener token desde Auth.http -> Login

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5005
@tenant = demo
@token = TU_TOKEN_AQUI

### 1. Obtener configuración actual
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configuracion
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Guardar / actualizar configuración (solo Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/configuracion
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

